              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Fallback and Logging",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A ==clear message==, not a raw {red:stack trace}",
                "A ==Retry== button calling `resetErrorBoundary`",
                "A way to ==navigate away==",
                "Log in `onError` / `componentDidCatch`: users never see the console"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "jsx",
              "lines": [
                "<ErrorBoundary",
                "  FallbackComponent={Fallback}",
                "  onError={(e, info) =>",
                "    Sentry.captureException(e, { extra: info })}",
                "><Widget /></ErrorBoundary>"
              ],
              "note": "Sentry here is the monitoring service"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Loading UX",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
